        "product_summary": "Low-top everyday profile: A plain rounded forefoot and continuous side panel create a clean casual look for footwear collections.\n\nEyelet lacing: The front lace row allows the opening to be adjusted, with contrasting pale laces visible on both colour options.\n\nDistinctive sole stripe: A thin upper-edge stripe runs around the off-white PVC sole band, separating the upper from the sole.\n\nVisible outsole texture: The forefoot underside has a repeated geometric pattern shown in the close-up photograph.\n\nTwo colour directions: Black and Khaki are listed in EU39-44 for wholesale colour-size assortments.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
